  {
   "id": "implement-trie-prefix-tree",
   "num": 4,
   "leet_id": 208,
   "title_cn": "实现 Trie (前缀树)",
   "title_en": "Implement Trie (Prefix Tree)",
   "difficulty": "中等",
   "category": "graph",
   "tags": [
    "设计",
    "字典树",
    "哈希表",
    "字符串"
   ],
   "statement": {
    "desc": [
     "实现 **Trie（前缀树）**，支持：`insert(word)` 插入单词、`search(word)` 搜索完整单词、`startsWith(prefix)` 搜索前缀。",
     "Trie：每个节点存一个字符，从根到节点的路径拼成字符串；查询 O(L) 与词表大小无关。"
    ],
    "examples": [
     {
      "input": "[\"Trie\",\"insert\",\"search\",\"search\",\"startsWith\"]",
      "output": "-"
     },
     {
      "input": "insert(\"apple\"); search(\"apple\") → true; search(\"app\") → false; startsWith(\"app\") → true",
      "output": "-"
     }
    ],
    "constraints": [
     "1 <= word.length, prefix.length <= 2000",
     "所有输入由小写字母组成"
    ]
   },
   "solution": {
    "idea": [
     "Trie 节点 = 哈希表（字符→孩子）+ 词尾标记 `is_end`。三个操作共用一个「沿字符走路」的辅助逻辑。",
     "`insert`：逐字符下走，缺节点就建；走完把末节点标记 `is_end = True`（区分「单词」与「仅前缀」）。",
     "`search` 与 `startsWith`：同样逐字符下走——任何字符缺失就失败；区别在于前者还要求末节点 `is_end == True`，后者只要路走通了就算前缀存在。"
    ],
    "steps": [
     "节点结构：`children` 哈希表 + `is_end` 标记",
     "`insert`：逐字符走，缺则建节点；末节点 `is_end = True`",
     "`search`：逐字符走到底，要求 `is_end == True`",
     "`startsWith`：逐字符走到底，不要求 `is_end`"
    ],
    "complexity": {
     "time": "O(L)（L 为单词长度）",
     "space": "O(字符集 × 总字符数)"
    },
    "code": "class Trie:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.children = {}    # 字符 → 子节点\n        self.is_end = False   # 词尾标记\n\n    def insert(self, word: str) -> None:\n        node = self\n        for ch in word:\n            if ch not in node.children:\n                node.children[ch] = Trie()\n            node = node.children[ch]\n        node.is_end = True\n\n    def search(self, word: str) -> bool:\n        node = self._walk(word)\n        return node is not None and node.is_end\n\n    def startsWith(self, prefix: str) -> bool:\n        return self._walk(prefix) is not None\n\n    def _walk(self, s):\n        node = self\n        for ch in s:\n            if ch not in node.children:\n                return None\n            node = node.children[ch]\n        return node"
   },
